The initial v0.1 implementation ports the behavior of the upstream
"委托助手" (Commission Assistant) story/dialogue skip flow, screen definitions
and the small template images referenced by that flow. See docs/upstream.md
for the file-by-file mapping and modification notes.

The Wuthering Waves ("鸣潮") story skip flow references the behavior of:

  ok-wuthering-waves
  https://github.com/ok-oldking/ok-wuthering-waves
  Copyright (C) ok-oldking contributors
  Licensed under AGPL-3.0

The Go implementation is original: only the flow, timings and key bindings were
used as a reference. Part of the template images under assets/games/wuwa are
crops of that project's shipped template set (assets/templates), which is
AGPL-3.0; shipping them here makes those files subject to AGPL-3.0 and, when
redistributed together, the combined work should be treated as AGPL-3.0 rather
than GPL-3.0 alone. Templates that are not marked as upstream crops
(skip_dialog, skip_dialog_wide) were cropped from in-game screenshots; game
artwork belongs to its respective rights holders.

